  "description": "Vali-FileSize is a lightweight .NET library for converting and formatting file sizes across all major units: bytes, kilobytes, megabytes, gigabytes, terabytes, petabytes, and exabytes — including full IEC binary prefix support (KiB, MiB, GiB, TiB, PiB, EiB). It provides a clean API with automatic unit detection, human-readable formatting, customizable decimal precision, and cultural number formatting. Includes extension methods on double and long for minimal-boilerplate usage, an IValiFileSize interface for dependency injection, and IntelliSense documentation out of the box.",
  "iconFile": "logo-vali-filesize.png",
  "id": "Vali-FileSize",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-03-11T01:53:57.25Z",
