  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 79510,
  "published": "2026-03-11T01:50:53.223Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Vali-FileSize v1.1.0:\n            - Added support for Exabytes (EB) and Exbibytes (EiB) — the full unit range now covers bytes through exabytes.\n            - Added full IEC binary prefix support (KiB, MiB, GiB, TiB, PiB, EiB) via useIec flag on GetBestUnit and FormatBestSize.\n            - Added FormatBestSize method combining GetBestUnit and FormatSize in a single call.\n            - Added extension methods on double and long (ToFormattedSize, FormatBestSize, GetBestUnit) for minimal-boilerplate usage.\n            - Added IValiFileSize interface for dependency injection.\n            - Expanded target frameworks to netstandard2.0, netstandard2.1, net6.0, net7.0, net8.0, and net9.0.\n            - IntelliSense XML documentation now included in the package.",
